♪ Precious memories ♪

1458
01:43:09.617 --> 01:43:14.666
♪ Oh. how they linger ♪

1459
01:43:15.232 --> 01:43:20.237
♪ How they ever. ever flood my soul ♪

1460
01:43:23.675 --> 01:43:25.938
♪ Precious memories ♪

1461
01:43:26.112 --> 01:43:29.246
♪ Oh. how they linger ♪

1462
01:43:32.205 --> 01:43:34.251
Y'all have just witnessed

1463
01:43:34.425 --> 01:43:37.863
what happens when Satan controls a man.

1464
01:43:39.125 --> 01:43:42.694
You've seen it in living color.

1465
01:43:42.868 --> 01:43:46.306
It's embarrassing and shocking.

1466
01:43:46.480 --> 01:43:50.092
but y'all saw the initial me.

1467
01:43:50.919 --> 01:43:54.183
The acts of the sinful nature are obvious.

1468
01:43:54.358 --> 01:43:57.578
Y'all just saw the acts
of the sinful nature.

1469
01:43:57.752 --> 01:43:59.232
They're obvious.

1470
01:43:59.406 --> 01:44:03.541
Jesus beat death for us. removed our sin.

1471
01:44:03.715 --> 01:44:07.936
cleans us up and guarantees
he'll raise ya from the dead.

1472
01:44:08.110 --> 01:44:11.070
I wanna remind ya of the
gospel I preach to ya.

1473
01:44:11.244 --> 01:44:14.943
which you received. I did. 50 years ago.

1474
01:44:16.423 --> 01:44:19.861
And on which you've
taken your stand. I did.

1475
01:44:20.993 --> 01:44:25.214
I'm standin' on the death barrel
and resurrection of Jesus.

1476
01:44:25.389 --> 01:44:29.958
You really can have love. joy. peace.

1477
01:44:30.959 --> 01:44:33.614
patience. kindness. goodness.

1478
01:44:33.788 --> 01:44:37.270
faithfulness. gentleness. self-control.

1479
01:44:37.444 --> 01:44:41.100
You can have those
qualities for your own life

1480
01:44:41.970 --> 01:44:45.104
if you come to Jesus through faith.

1481
01:44:45.278 --> 01:44:46.975
believe he died before he was buried

1482
01:44:47.149 --> 01:44:48.803
and raised from the dead.

1483
01:44:48.977 --> 01:44:52.198
He's seated at the right
hand of the Father right now.

1484
01:44:52.372 --> 01:44:54.287
It's a wonderful thing.

1485
01:44:54.461 --> 01:44:59.423
and I highly recommend you
just start walking by faith.

1486
01:45:01.903 --> 01:45:05.516
My question is. you got a better story?

1487
01:45:05.690 --> 01:45:07.126
I'd love to hear it.

1488
01:45:07.300 --> 01:45:11.435
We could be wrong. but I doubt it.

1489
01:45:33.065 --> 01:45:34.458
A lotta people said.

1490
01:45:34.632 --> 01:45:38.375
"If you played ahead of Bradshaw at Tech.

1491
01:45:39.637 --> 01:45:41.421
and he went on to win four Superbowls."

1492
01:45:41.595 --> 01:45:44.772
they said. "Man. what in
the world happened to you?"

1493
01:45:47.862 --> 01:45:51.431
I really don't know what
to tell 'em except Bradshaw

1494
01:45:51.605 --> 01:45:54.303
went after the books and
I went after the ducks.

1495
01:45:55.304 --> 01:45:57.742
And I think we're both pretty happy. so.

